.TH CHIMERA-UTILS 1
.SH NAME
chimera-utils \- native Chimera filesystem and text utility multiplexer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chimera-utils
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Provides the existing portable utility set including pwd, whoami, echo, ls, cat, head, tail, wc, mkdir, touch, cp, mv, rm, uname, date, grep, and env.
